Subject: [PATCH] media: add Xiaomi 12S Pro D-PHY sensor pipelines

Add the board-specific 19.2 MHz S5KJN1 and OV32B40 modes, runtime power
sequencing and V4L2 exposure/gain controls. Wire ultra, tele and front to
CCI and CSI PHYs using the OEM module addresses and board regulator map.
Pass the bit clock to the generic D-PHY API while retaining DDR link
frequency for the Qualcomm settle-time and clock-scaling calculations.

IMX707 remains disabled: it requires three-trio C-PHY receiver support.
Register provenance and unverified hardware limitations are documented in
docs/unicorn/camera.md in the parent nixos-android-devices repository.

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig b/drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig
@@ -4,6 +4,17 @@
 #
 
 if VIDEO_DEV
+
+config VIDEO_UNICORN_SENSORS
+	tristate "Xiaomi 12S Pro S5KJN1 and OV32B40 camera modules"
+	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV
+	select V4L2_CCI_I2C
+	select V4L2_FWNODE
+	select VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API
+	help
+	  Native RAW10 capture for the Unicorn ultra-wide, telephoto and
+	  front camera modules using their stock 19.2 MHz mode settings.
+	  The IMX707 main camera uses C-PHY and is not supported here.
 
 comment "IR I2C driver auto-selected by 'Autoselect ancillary drivers'"
 	depends on MEDIA_SUBDRV_AUTOSELECT && I2C && RC_CORE
diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/Makefile b/drivers/media/i2c/Makefile
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/Makefile
@@ -174,3 +174,5 @@
 obj-$(CONFIG_VIDEO_WM8739) += wm8739.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_VIDEO_WM8775) += wm8775.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_VIDEO_INTEL_CVS) += cvs/
+
+obj-$(CONFIG_VIDEO_UNICORN_SENSORS) += unicorn-sensors.o
diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/unicorn-sensor-regs.h b/drivers/media/i2c/unicorn-sensor-regs.h
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/unicorn-sensor-regs.h
@@ -0,0 +1,2987 @@
